colspan='14'> <b>Instructor Name: Puneet  Mehrotra</b> </div><table style='font: 15px arial, san serif; border-collapse: collapse; border:1px solid ' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' id='tbl_lecture' width='100%'> <tbody><tr style='border: 1px solid;'><td style='border:1px solid;border-bottom:0;width: 42px; padding: 4px 7px;'><center> Sr No.</center></td> <td style='border:1px solid;'> <center>Comments </center> </td> </tr> <tr style='border: 1px solid;'><td style='border:1px solid; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px;'><center>1</center></td><td style='border:1px solid; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px;'>very good Instructor</td></tr><tr style='border: 1px solid;'><td style='border:1px solid; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px;'><center>2</center></td><td style='border:1px solid; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px;'>Thanks for sharing your experience with us. For next time: Support students with innovative ideas, who manipulate your guidelines to produce better. And accept different ideas, improve and guide to make them better.Suggestion: timely submissions are a must, true, but if that encourages students to make any last minute articles, then you lose the motive of the course. In short, on time submissions should be encouraged, but better craftsmanship should be your first priority.</td></tr><tr style='border: 1px solid;'><td style='border:1px solid; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px;'><center>3</center></td><td style='border:1px solid; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px;'>.</td></tr><tr style='border: 1px solid;'><td style='border:1px solid; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px;'><center>4</center></td><td style='border:1px solid; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px;'>Great faculty...</td></tr><tr style='border: 1px solid;'><td style='border:1px solid; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px;'><center>5</center></td><td style='border:1px solid; padding-left: 5px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px;'>Very critical, and makes us work hard which is good. Should be more clear on what is expected and what the goals are.</td></tr></tbody></table><div style='font-size: 15px;'>Comments are reproduced verbatim from the feedback received</div> </div>";
